---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { tools } from '../lib/catalog';
---
<Layout title="Free Online PDF, Image, Markdown & JSON Tools | FilePebble" description="Free online tools to merge and split PDFs, convert and compress images, compare text, format JSON, and convert Markdown. No signup; files processed in your browser.">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-square"></span> YOUR EVERYDAY FILE TOOLKIT</div>
      <h1>Small tools.<br />Better <span class="serif-accent">files.</span></h1>
      <p>Convert your notes. Compare your changes.<br class="desktop-br" /> Clean up your data. All in one quiet corner of the web.</p>
      <a href="#tools" class="primary-link">Find your tool <span>↗</span></a>
      <div class="hero-trust"><span>✓ No account needed</span><span>✓ Processed on your device</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-preview" aria-label="Example text comparison">
      <div class="preview-top"><span><i></i> A LITTLE CHANGE, CLEARLY SEEN</span><span>01 / {String(tools.length).padStart(2, '0')}</span></div>
      <div class="demo-title"><span class="demo-icon">±</span><div><strong>Text comparison</strong><small>Find what changed. Keep what matters.</small></div></div>
      <div class="demo-code"><div class="demo-label"><span>ORIGINAL → UPDATED</span><span>example.txt</span></div><div><b>01</b><code># A better way to work</code></div><div class="removed"><b>02</b><code>− Upload your files to a server.</code></div><div class="added"><b>02</b><code>+ Keep your files on your device.</code></div><div><b>03</b><code>Convert. Compare. Carry on.</code></div></div>
      <div class="demo-bottom"><span><i class="green-dot"></i> 1 line added · 1 line removed</span><a href="/tools/text-diff">Try it yourself ↗</a></div>
      <div class="preview-note">Your files have places to go.<br /><em>Our servers aren't one of them.</em></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="tool-section wrap" id="tools">
    <div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">LESS BUSYWORK. MORE DONE.</div><h2>What are we working on?</h2></div><label class="search-box"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="tool-search" type="search" placeholder="Find a tool…" aria-label="Search tools" /><kbd>/</kbd></label></div>
    <div class="category-row"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter tools">{['All tools', 'Markdown', 'Compare', 'Data', 'Images', 'PDF'].map((category, i) => <button data-category={category} class={i === 0 ? 'active' : ''} aria-pressed={i === 0}>{category}{i === 0 && <span>{tools.length}</span>}</button>)}</div><span class="tool-count" aria-live="polite"><b id="result-count">{tools.length}</b> useful tools, zero fuss</span></div>
    <div class="tool-grid">{tools.map(tool => <a class="tool-card" href={`/tools/${tool.id}`} data-category={tool.category} data-search={`${tool.name} ${tool.description} ${tool.category}`}><div class="card-top"><span class:list={['tool-icon', tool.category.toLowerCase()]}>{tool.symbol}</span><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></div><h3>{tool.name}</h3><p>{tool.description}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>{tool.input}<b>→</b>{tool.output}</span><span class="local-tag"><i></i> LOCAL</span></div></a>)}</div>
    <p id="no-results" class="empty-search" hidden>No tools match that search. Try “Markdown”, “JSON”, or “compare”.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="featured-guide wrap" aria-labelledby="guide-csv">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">LEARN BY EXAMPLE</div><h2 id="guide-csv">Compare CSV exports without false differences</h2><p>Records can move between exports without actually changing. Follow a real before-and-after example to compare by ID, find edited cells, and recognise added and removed rows.</p></div>
    <a href="/guides/compare-csv-files-by-id/">Read the CSV comparison guide ↗</a>
  </section>
  <section class="values-strip wrap"><div><span>01</span><h3>Your device does the work.</h3><p>File contents stay in your browser. No uploads required.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Straight to the useful part.</h3><p>No registration, email gates, or waiting in a conversion queue.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>A growing little toolkit.</h3><p>Image tools and PDF essentials are here. <a href="/about">See the roadmap ↗</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
<script>
  const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#tool-search')!;
  const buttons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-category]:is(button)');
  const cards = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.tool-card');
  let category = 'All tools';
  function filter() {
    let count = 0;
    for (const card of cards) {
      const visible = (category === 'All tools' || card.dataset.category === category) && card.dataset.search!.toLowerCase().includes(input.value.trim().toLowerCase());
      card.hidden = !visible;
      if (visible) count++;
    }
    document.querySelector('#result-count')!.textContent = String(count);
    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#no-results')!.hidden = count > 0;
  }
  input.addEventListener('input', filter);
  buttons.forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
    category = button.dataset.category!;
    buttons.forEach(b => { b.classList.toggle('active', b === button); b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b === button)); });
    filter();
  }));
  document.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
    if (event.key === '/' && !(event.target instanceof HTMLInputElement || event.target instanceof HTMLTextAreaElement)) { event.preventDefault(); input.focus(); }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .featured-guide{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;padding-top:38px;padding-bottom:38px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
  .featured-guide h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin:11px 0}
  .featured-guide p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);max-width:610px;margin:0}
  .featured-guide>a{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;flex-shrink:0}
  @media(max-width:650px){.featured-guide{display:block;padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:30px}.featured-guide>a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px}}
</style>
